GRACoL2013_CRPC6.icc
====================

This directory bundles the GRACoL2013_CRPC6 CMYK output profile, used as
the PDF/X-1a OutputIntent for `holiday-card create --export-for moo-a6`.
It is redistributed unmodified.

Source: International Color Consortium (ICC) Profile Registry
        https://www.color.org/registry/GRACoL2013_CRPC6.xalter
Download: https://www.color.org/registry/profiles/GRACoL2013_CRPC6.icc
Characterization data: CGATS21-2-CRPC6 (ISO DIS 15339-2, CGATS.21-2)
Profile ID: 978f11fd 9202f7de 7acf16ac c355750a
            (matches the bundled file, header bytes 84-99)

